---
source: crates/instrukt-cli/tests/harness.rs
expression: help
---
Validate, list and read documentation snippets

Usage: instrukt docs <COMMAND>

Commands:
  validate  Check the repository's documentation against the snippet contract
  fold      Apply one delivery's pending documentation to the working tree
  index     List published snippet ids with their descriptions (phase 1)
  get       Read snippets through the read pipeline (phase 2)
  help      Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
